== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Charred Marksman|Aggressive creature strategies#Charred Marksman}}

=== Bow ===
Nocks an arrow and shoots the player (90 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). This attack has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 20 meters of a player. The arrow has an initial velocity of 40 meters per second and can travel for up to 4 seconds before disappearing. It has a spread of 2–20 degrees. This attack has a random spread of up to 2 degrees.

=== Bow volley ===
Aims 25 degrees upward before drawing back and shooting a volley of ten arrows in the direction of the player (60 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage each). This attack has a 4-second cooldown and can be used when between 20–100 meters of a player. Each arrow has a random initial velocity between 20–40 meters per second and can travel for up to 4 seconds before disappearing. This attack has a random spread of up to 12 degrees for each projectile.

== Lore ==
{{Quote|But for those who are burned by a drake's fire, the blessing is a curse. They are killed and quickened at the same time, caught forever between death and life. Such are the unfortunate souls who wander this ruined land, with flames for flesh and agony in every moment. They cannot be destroyed, only pitied.|Runestone}}
